Google Scanned Objects
----------------------

The following base-object directories contain assets adapted from the Google
Scanned Objects dataset:

- `bumblebee/`, `grimlock/`, `mario/`, `thomas/`, and `porter/`
- `mouse_black_taipan/`, `mouse_white_taipan/`, and `mouse_naga/`
- `ink_cartridge_green/`, `ink_cartridge_magenta/`,
  `ink_cartridge_red/`, and `ink_cartridge_white/`
- `shoe_left/` and `shoe_right/`
- `school_bus/`, `mini_fire_engine/`, `mini_roller/`, and `dragon/`
- `headset/` and `keyboard/`

"Google Scanned Objects", Copyright 2020 Google LLC, is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license:

- Source:
  https://research.google/blog/scanned-objects-by-google-research-a-dataset-of-3d-scanned-common-household-items/
- License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

These assets have been adapted for MuJoCo and LIBERO-Industry. Changes may
include scaling, orientation, mesh conversion, collision geometry, packaging,
and simulation metadata.

CGTrader source assets
----------------------

The following directories contain adaptations of models obtained from
CGTrader:

- `cream_jar/`, `serum_bottle/`, `cream_bottle/`, and `pump_bottle/`:
  "Skincare Cosmetics Pack" by ProductViz3D (2025),
  https://www.cgtrader.com/free-3d-models/industrial/other/skincare-cosmetics-pack
- `conveyor_belt/`: "Conveyor Belt Assembly Line" by Lovano (2023),
  https://www.cgtrader.com/free-3d-models/industrial/industrial-machine/conveyor-belt-assembly-line

The source pages list both models under the CGTrader Royalty Free License
(No AI). The applicable terms for redistribution of the adapted assets will be
confirmed before public release.

